168	/// package file's, not the project's, and the project's demand was followed. The session's answer without the nested
169	/// file is not kept, so once the file reads the next request has the inherited prop, the same as a fresh session. On
170	/// the base the retry guard looked only at the project file's demands, and the memo kept `["own", "title"]`.
